			</div> <!-- .et_pb_section --><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
					<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_2">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_5    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text --><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					<h2>MEETING PLANNER</h2>
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text --><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					Plan with the largest conference space in the city
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text --><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0 et_always_center_on_mobile">
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/intercontinental-elvalaszto-2.png" alt=""/></span>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					<p> InterContinental Budapest has the most spacious conference room among the city’s most elegant hotels with meeting and breakout rooms on the same floor. Do you feel the group will need space for ideas? Ask us to open every door, barrier and wall to create one big space so that creativity can flow freely! The entire floor can be rearranged in numerous ways – thanks to the retractable walls, blinds and partitions, any kind of event from a 10-person meeting to an 850-person conference may be executed just as you planned on our event floor.</p>
<p>Our professional team with decades of experience is ready to help you find the best setup for your event.</p>
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text -->
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column -->
				
				
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_row --><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_3">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_right">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					<h3><img class="wp-image-8164 alignright size-full" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/meeting-planner-idezet-ikon-plusz.png" alt="" width="145" height="196"/>GREAT IDEAS REWRITE THE FUTURE.</h3>
<p>Bíró László József – 1938. – Inventor of Ballpoint pen
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text -->
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column -->
				
				
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_row --><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_4">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_7    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1 et_always_center_on_mobile">
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/meeting-planner-toll-arnyekkal.png" alt=""/></span>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					 GREAT IDEAS REWRITE THE FUTURE.
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text --><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_bg_layout_light  et_pb_text_align_center">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					<p>Bíró László József – 1938. – Inventor of Ballpoint pen</p>
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text -->
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column -->
				
				
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_row --><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_5">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_8    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et-waypoint et_pb_image et_pb_animation_fade_in et_pb_image_n10s_0 et_always_center_on_mobile"><div class="n10s-block n10s-berlin"><picture><source srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/meeting-planner-ballroom.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/meeting-planner-ballroom.jpg" alt="" class="webpexpress-processed"></picture><div class="n10s-overlay"><h2>Ballroom <span></span></h2><p class="description">Big ideas need big space. Host your next event in our ballroom which is the city's largest naturally lit space with a capacity of 850 persons.</p></div></div></div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column --><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_9    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et-waypoint et_pb_image et_pb_animation_fade_in et_pb_image_n10s_1 et_always_center_on_mobile"><div class="n10s-block n10s-berlin"><picture><source srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/meeting-planner-szekcio-termek.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20231003093241im_/https://www.budapest.intercontinental.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/meeting-planner-szekcio-termek.jpg" alt="" class="webpexpress-processed"></picture><div class="n10s-overlay"><h2>Breakout rooms <span></span></h2><p class="description">The 9 breakout rooms, located on the same level as the ballroom, are perfectly suited to complement large meetings or for more intimate gatherings.</p></div></div></div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column --><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_10    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
