				<div class="et_pb_text_inner">
					<h2>BALLROOM</h2>
<p>Big ideas need big space. Host your next event in our ballroom which is the city&#8217;s largest naturally lit space with a capacity of 850 persons.
				</div>
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_text -->
			</div> <!-- .et_pb_column --><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_12    et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
