      <p>These cookies allow for the gathering of information about how our visitors use our website (e.g., which page the visitor viewed, which part of it they clicked on, how much time they spent on each page). The purpose of all this is to improve our website and the services it provides, thereby enhancing the user experience and ensuring uninterrupted and high-quality service delivery.</p>
